# ADVシーン
# ==============================================================================

@Gosub System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-First
@pauseTrial true
@Gosub System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-Effect
@Gosub System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-Last

#
# 議論終了
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

@ResetText 
@char Ema.Pensive1,ArmR4,ArmL5,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Determined_Closed
@gosubModifyCamera 0
@Wait 0.2

@print （死体の状況に大きな間違いはなさそうかな……？） { author:Ema speed:1 waitInput:true Wait:true }

@ResetText 
@char Meruru.Default,ArmR1_1,ArmL8,Eyes1_Pensive_Open2,Mouth1_Normal_Open2
@gosubSplitStageScreen 1

@print ……エマさん。<br>少しだけ今の証言、違和感がありませんでしたか？ { author:Meruru speed:1 waitInput:true Wait:true }

@char Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3,ArmL1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Surprised_Open01,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Cry_Open

@print そ、そうかな……？<br>ちょっと確認してみるね……！ { author:Ema speed:1 waitInput:true Wait:true }

@hideStageScreen 1
@char Ema.Default,ArmR3,ArmL1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Determined_Closed

@print （メルルちゃんはミリアちゃんの死体を詳しく見てるはず……。<br>　ならその違和感は、もしかして……？） { author:Ema speed:1 waitInput:true Wait:true }

@goto .Judge2-2-1

